<title>USA: Hayes, Microcom in strategic partnership.</title>
<headline>Hayes, Microcom in strategic partnership.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Microcomputer Products Inc said on Monday that it and Microcom Inc will collaborate on a full range of data communications and remote access products.</p>
<p>The companies plan to draw from the technology in Microcom's ISPorte chassis and from that in Hayes' client and server remote access products.</p>
<p>The two companies also said they will begin joint 56-kilobyte modem trials soon.</p>
